                    <div class="about-tab-text">
                      <h3 class="font-medium">Making Complex Work More Manageable</h3>
                      <p class="font-regular is-purpose">Our goal is to empower industrial companies to navigate the complexities of equipment selection and tackle technical challenges effectively. We provide insightful guidance and well-structured solutions that are tailored to meet the unique needs of each business, ensuring they can make informed decisions with confidence.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-button-wrap">
