        <div class="section-gap is-large">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="faq-layout">
              <div class="faq-intro">
                <div class="faq-header w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div to-top-0="" class="font-extra-small">Common Questions</div>
                  <h2 heading-rebuild="" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;5cf8e4eb-bd25-1b84-080f-c6556ff2902f&quot;,&quot;5cf8e4eb-bd25-1b84-080f-c6556ff29037&quot;],[&quot;5f7ada98-57fe-f4d7-5f4e-e8b838ccade2&quot;]]]" class="section-heading faq">Here&#x27;s the scoop on Engineering and Design!</h2>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="faq-image-wrap"><img class="faq-image" src="/images/Rectangle-32-1.webp" width="1220" height="940" alt="Forklift moving boxes inside a warehouse" sizes="(max-width: 1220px) 100vw, 1220px" parallax="" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/Rectangle-32-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Rectangle-32-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Rectangle-32-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Rectangle-32-1.webp 1220w"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-list">
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">What does your engineering and design service include?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Depending on project scope, support may include concept development, equipment layout planning, technical design considerations, and integration planning.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">Can you help plan a custom equipment solution?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Yes. We review the task, loads, cycles, and operating environment first, then outline a practical direction for a custom setup.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">What information should I provide before starting?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Share your application, site dimensions, throughput targets, existing equipment, and timeline so the team can review requirements quickly.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">Can you work with existing equipment?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Yes. We assess what you already run and plan new equipment or upgrades so everything works together on your floor.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">Do you support projects from planning through installation?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Yes. We can stay involved from early planning and design through delivery, installation, and commissioning checks.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item w-variant-937ceca9-3df4-4f68-7d84-66c1097d3252">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">How do I request an engineering consultation?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Use the contact form to describe your project and goals. The team will follow up to schedule a consultation and clarify next steps.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
